---
pageType: page
title: "Where We Buy Houses | Gaston, Cleveland & Lincoln County NC"
description: "Cities and towns where Monthaven buys houses for cash: Gastonia, Shelby, Kings Mountain, Belmont, Mount Holly, Bessemer City, Cherryville, Dallas, Stanley and Lincolnton NC."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Areas We Buy"
    url: "/service-areas/"
---
{% from "components/lead-form.njk" import leadForm with context %}
{% import "components/blocks.njk" as b with context %}

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Service area</p>
    <h1>Where we buy houses</h1>
    <p class="lead mt-5">
      Gaston, Cleveland, and Lincoln counties in North Carolina. We keep the radius tight on
      purpose &mdash; we walk every property ourselves, and we can't do that well across
      half the state.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% for county in site.serviceAreaCounties %}
{% set countyName = county | replace(" County", "") %}
{% set countyCities = cities | where("county", countyName) %}
{% if countyCities.length %}
<section class="section{% if loop.index0 % 2 == 1 %} section--soft{% endif %}">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="mb-4">{{ county }}, NC</h2>
    {% set hub = counties | findBySlug(countyName | lower) %}
    {% if hub %}
    <p class="lead mb-5">
      {{ hub.intro }}
      <a href="/we-buy-houses-{{ hub.slug }}-county-nc/">More about buying in {{ county }} &rarr;</a>
    </p>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% for c in countyCities %}
      <a class="card card--link" href="/sell-my-house-fast-{{ c.slug }}-nc/">
        <h3>{{ c.name }}, NC</h3>
        <p>{{ c.whyWeBuyHere }}</p>
        <p class="small muted mt-4">
          {% for z in c.zips %}{{ z }}{% if not loop.last %} &middot; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </p>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow stack-lg">
    <h2>Don't see your town?</h2>
    <p>
      The towns above have their own pages. Beyond them we buy in the smaller communities
      across all three counties &mdash; Lattimore, Waco, Kingstown, Fallston, Polkville,
      Casar, Belwood, Earl, Mooresboro, Patterson Springs, Lawndale, Spencer Mountain, Alexis
      and others. They're listed on the county pages. If your house is in Gaston, Cleveland,
      or Lincoln County, ask.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you're outside those three counties, tell us anyway. If we can't buy it, we'll say
      so quickly rather than waste your time, and we'll usually know someone who does work
      that area.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{{ b.ctaBand() }}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">{{ leadForm("bottom-form", "full") }}</div>
</section>
